    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Lignes de logs",
      "description": "Nombre de lignes écrites par les services choisis (variable source) sur la période affichée. Le gros du volume vient des contrôles de santé et des appels de la sonde (normal).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum(count_over_time({stack=\"paiement\", service=~\"$source\", host=~\"$host\"} |~ \"(?i)$recherche\" [$__range]))) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "text": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Erreurs",
      "description": "Lignes d'erreur reconnues au contenu : niveau JSON error, [error] nginx, réponse HTTP 5xx, trace Python. Le label Loki « level » n'est pas utilisé : il vaut « error » pour tout ce qui sort sur stderr. Des 502 apparaissent pendant chaque redémarrage de payment-api (remédiation) : c'est attendu.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum(count_over_time({stack=\"paiement\", service=~\"$source\", host=~\"$host\"} |~ `(?i)(\"level\": \"(error|critical)\"|level=(error|fatal)|\\[(error|crit|alert|emerg)\\]|HTTP/[0-9.]+\" 5[0-9]{2} |traceback|exception|panic)` !~ `column \"first_name\" already exists` |~ \"(?i)$recherche\" [$__range]))) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
